/*/{Protheus.doc} beforeCreateInTransaction
Define QEJ_CODTAB automaticamente conforme o cadastro (I.Q.S.),
reproduzindo A270ITab (nOpc==3: QEJ_CODTAB:='2'), sem exigir
digitacao do usuario. Valida duplicidade de QEJ_FATOR (Help legado
JAGRAVADO) sem desconsiderar nenhum registro, pois e' inclusao.
@type method
@author willian.ramalho
@since 25/08/2026
@param oData, object, Dados da operacao
@param oModel, object, Modelo SmartX
@param oError, object, Retorno de erro
@return logical, Permissao para incluir
/*/
method beforeCreateInTransaction(oData as object, oModel as object, oError as object) as logical class QualityFactorsIQSEvents
    oData:setFieldValue("QEJ", "QEJ_CODTAB",, ::cCodTab)
    If !self:validateFactorDuplicate(oData, oError, 0)
        Return .F.
    EndIf
return self:validateUpperValueDuplicate(oData, oError, 0)
